        "heading": "More info",
        "text": "<p>British Lingerie Studio helps you find a bra that fits, with tools you can use at home in a few minutes.</p><p>If you prefer to measure, our bra size calculator walks you through two measurements with a soft tape and turns them into your BLS size. If you already know your size, enter your band and cup on the I Know My Size page to see your sister sizes and the styles in stock in your size.</p><p>A bra that fits supports you, feels comfortable all day and looks better under your clothes. Our bras come in bands 32 to 44 and cups A to F, in padded, non-padded, wired and wireless styles, with matching panties, camisoles, sleepwear and shapewear.</p>",
